<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/msa@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/msa@> .
